### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 3: Validation Error - Missing Timesteps (Only 3 timesteps)
### Expected: 400 Bad Request, "sequence must contain exactly 12 time-ordered metric observations"
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/predict
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "service_id": "payment-service",
  "sequence": [
    { "cpu": 55.0, "ram": 60.0, "disk": 40.0, "latency": 120.0, "request_rate": 200.0, "http_5xx_rate": 0.5, "pod_restart_count": 0, "replica_count": 3 },
    { "cpu": 58.5, "ram": 61.2, "disk": 40.5, "latency": 135.0, "request_rate": 220.0, "http_5xx_rate": 0.6, "pod_restart_count": 0, "replica_count": 3 },
    { "cpu": 63.0, "ram": 63.0, "disk": 41.0, "latency": 150.0, "request_rate": 250.0, "http_5xx_rate": 0.8, "pod_restart_count": 0, "replica_count": 3 }
  ]
}

